name examz
category Package
revision 67303
shortdesc Randomized exams with multiple versions
relocated 1
longdesc The 'examz' document class builds on the 'exam' document class
longdesc that was developed by Philip S. Hirschhorn. An author may use
longdesc the class exactly as the 'exam' class, but there are also
longdesc additional features. The document class facilitates the writing
longdesc of questions with random elements, the creation of multiple
longdesc versions of an exam, and the use of separate files as question
longdesc banks.
runfiles size=2
 RELOC/tex/latex/examz/examz.cls
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/roguewhistler/examz
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/examz
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics exam class
catalogue-version 1.0.0
